<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Halaman Tidak Ditemukan - M1 Ekosistem</title>
    <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        sans: ['Outfit', 'sans-serif'],
                    },
                    colors: {
                        navy: {
                            800: '#0f172a',
                            900: '#0b1120',
                            950: '#020617',
                        },
                        electric: '#2563eb',
                        racing: '#dc2626',
                        silver: '#94a3b8',
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-navy-950 text-gray-100 antialiased selection:bg-electric selection:text-white flex flex-col min-h-screen">
    
    <main class="flex-grow flex items-center justify-center pt-10 pb-20 relative overflow-hidden">
        <!-- Glow -->
        <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-electric/10 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 text-center relative z-10">
            <h1 class="text-9xl font-extrabold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-electric to-cyan-400 mb-6 drop-shadow-2xl">
                404
            </h1>
            <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Oops! Halaman Tidak Ditemukan.</h2>
            <p class="text-lg text-silver mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto">
                Maaf, halaman yang Anda cari mungkin telah dihapus, namanya diubah, atau sementara tidak tersedia.
            </p>
            <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-electric hover:bg-blue-600 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold transition-all shadow-lg shadow-electric/25 hover:shadow-electric/40 hover:-translate-y-1">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path></svg>
                Kembali ke Beranda
            </a>
        </div>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer Consistent -->
    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
